{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1500405-tips-for-rewriting-the-monastery-scene-in-blood-fire","id":1500405,"title":"Tips for rewriting the Monastery scene in Blood & Fire?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-22T16:07:54-08:00","id":1500405,"title":"Tips for rewriting the Monastery scene in Blood & Fire?","content":"I'm running the Giovanni Chronicles and as I read the scene in the Black Monastery, I'm reminded that this book was written pre dark ages. So the roads really weren't a thing because a lot of what the Sabbat talk about here exist as roads already. So, it'll have to be rewritten, any tips on how to do this?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27320-procyon668","name":"Procyon668","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-22T16:45:42-08:00","id":1500407,"title":"","content":"To be fair, it'll still be largely the same. You're just having people reconstruct the Lost Roads of the past rather than make them entirely new.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a hr